":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"563799","ru":"Клайд Купер","en":"Clyde Cooper","year":"2018","type":"Фильм","rating":4.5,"votes":11,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/6gTe5LyA5wjdQAWy7aEnrNpMFMq.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nWyQxUKrxOLk3YUDC0UyHompkFW.jpg","genres":["Детектив"],"overview":"Недалёкое будущее. Частный детектив Клайд Купер соглашается начать поиски пропавшей девушки, которой интересуется таинственная корпорация Кремниевой долины.","source":"tmdb","episodes":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"477848","ru":"В добром здравии","en":"Perfect sănătos","year":"2017","type":"Фильм","rating":4.5,"votes":11,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/8ZWyKmcotKnXpg0MbZgSa0fec0u.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/g1TlPYHYwd46XcxSWsjq8RVwKrc.jpg","genres":["Драма"],"overview":"Юрист собирает информацию о последнем дне жизни своего отца — судьи, загадочные обстоятельства смерти которого вызывают у окружающих подозрения насчет его молодой вдовы.","source":"tmdb","episodes":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"482706","ru":"올리고당 더 무비","en":"올리고당 더 무비","year":"2017","type":"Фильм","rating":4.5,"votes":11,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/8hRAm3H3wwBGRBCre6xfQfpwmHj.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fbWHVtOATFhpipizRBNeulJNbcH.jpg","genres":["Драма"],"overview":"","source":"tmdb","episodes":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"569578","ru":"Ascharyachakit!","en":"Ascharyachakit!","year":"2018","type":"Фильм","rating":4.5,"votes":11,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/jNThnK5uJS4g63CANGi7FukLgLt.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/uT0JMtEaVhPQwEUzovi44jJZdM4.jpg","genres":["Триллер","Драма"],"overview":"","source":"tmdb","episodes":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"525864","ru":"Groomzilla","en":"Groomzilla","year":"2018","type":"Фильм","rating":4.5,"votes":11,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/dS7U3qArQvbgpqP0hSQ3